{"4674940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Armored Mayhem", "steam_appid": 4674940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by a bunch of games that honestly shouldn’t fit together, I’d like to present you: <strong>Armored Mayhem</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s a vehicle combat game with randomized loot and PvP objectives. Every round starts from zero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You build your vehicle during the match, adapting to weapons and upgrades you find along the way. No fixed classes. Your build is your role.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Positioning, timing, and decision-making matter just as much as aim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock more vehicles, weapons, and upgrades over time and experiment with different builds.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by a bunch of games that honestly shouldn’t fit together, I’d like to present you: <strong>Armored Mayhem</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s a vehicle combat game with randomized loot and PvP objectives. Every round starts from zero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You build your vehicle during the match, adapting to weapons and upgrades you find along the way. No fixed classes. Your build is your role.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Positioning, timing, and decision-making matter just as much as aim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock more vehicles, weapons, and upgrades over time and experiment with different builds.</p>", "short_description": "Vehicular PvP combat with mid-match build crafting. Start with nothing, collect randomized weapons and upgrades, and adapt your vehicle.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4674940/ce04eaab9690a465ac7481793353829eddf565f4/header.jpg?t=1777662656", "caps